<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi forces are expanding border security by exploring Canadian drone technology and senior generals are inspecting army posture in Kirkuk, while a sting in Al-Anbar seized 34kg of drugs and arrested a suspect. A bomb attack targeted a government employee in Dhi Qar and an armed group warned it would respond forcefully if the US uses Iraqi airspace against Iran. A vessel caught fire off Iraq's coast, raising Gulf security concerns, and a commission released a document on Baghdad's deadly bombing of a Kurdish civilian camp in Iran. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQblJjbndSaGhwNmM2V2FpQXJjclAxZDdqTzh4a3VZWWd4WUFPUE1CcXdaSXRVZUdMYmtXdy1nNHRGckFRVFg2LUdOcGE5ZXpGZE1MZ2xPVndZRTRFc1NMTllZcU91NENSZTBEYkhIUGdTUU1ZUERKN3dCaE9ubkhyRmZpRHNNUXQ3U0daeDd6Wm9nLThNZzN6bg?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxORzg4ck0tMEFDWnBTanQyTTVsMmpPOUVCdzVCQzFWczJDSkFYSHAzVXBQbm5GcmZ5OVFqVzU5dlJLQVdybGI1THhlRUZsX2V0QU5kc0hFaXZINVItcjhwQk9YTFl6bkV3ejcySnZGa1lUSkx3SzNKS3BRaHRuTFpydXJzRnUtWDFQTlZud0Z6UUFFV21iNFVXN3ZfUThKN0EzZWNFX0F1VnNJZW4wOGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNSmZBMUotOTJvQUtKbUFIYTNHTVFDXzFjc2F6RU9pYlJ2S3VzWFluQXE2RmlXYmJOaG9OSHhIbFB2SXMtZnR3M08tSkRnbzdsMmV6MjZVYkVRNy1vemFrOUdDZGNnUWNTRVFRTm1STEE5REZJWU56MVQybkhCVlNRdEQ3Nk9YUVQ4TWJFaGxqSkw?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNTlhONWRvdXZ3dUswWjRSUmluYi1WalB5NFR0cnRfUXczaXFKcG1EVnZsX05PbzFTQ1ByZ0ZpaU9wMHRnN0hIdTRpekE2dU8xWmVsa3lMTHNIbHplTWtCbnQtdDczWjhlQ3M3b29wWjRIUThpbDdNV1N5RElGbExuYjVFSWNhUzdXdDJqbzJ2YXdKTzlJckZzdGVxRV9PZkctZS1rckhfbWRUcWwxUzRzaTV